        "front": "Penicillins work by which of the following mechanisms?<br><br>A. Inhibiting peptidoglycan cross-linking by binding to D-alanyl-D-alanine<br>B. Inhibiting protein synthesis by binding to 50S ribosomal subunits<br>C. Inhibiting protein synthesis by binding to 30S ribosomal subunits<br>D. Inhibiting DNA synthesis<br>E. Inhibiting peptidoglycan cross-linking by blocking transpeptidase",
