        "front": "1. Which phase of the action potential is most profoundly affected by local anesthesia?<br><br><div class=\"deck-options\">a. Resting<br>b. Repolarization<br>c. Slow depolarization<br>d. Rapid depolarization</div>",
        "rawOptions": "a. Resting<br>b. Repolarization<br>c. Slow depolarization<br>d. Rapid depolarization",
