        "front": "14. A patient who is on dicoumarol therapy require a tooth extraction. Which laboratory test is the most valuable in evaluation this patient's surgical risk?<br><br><div class=\"deck-options\">a. Clotting time<br>b. PTT<br>c. CBC<br>d. Bleeding time</div>",
