        "front": "16. Elective extractions on a patient who has had myocardial infarct two months prior are best:<br><br><div class=\"deck-options\">a. Performed under oral valium sedation<br>b. Performed using an epinephrine free local anesthetic<br>c. Performed using both of the above<br>d. Postponed until at least six months have elapsed</div>",
