        "front": "40. In fracture of zygomatic maxillary arch, the most definite checkpoint for zygomatic arch reduction is:<br><br><div class=\"deck-options\">a. Click on reduction<br>b. Inferior orbital rim symmetry on both the halves<br>c. Zygomatic buttress symmetry on right and left halves<br>d. Zygomatic arch symmetry on right and left halves</div>",
        "rawOptions": "a. Click on reduction<br>b. Inferior orbital rim symmetry on both the halves<br>c. Zygomatic buttress symmetry on right and left halves<br>d. Zygomatic arch symmetry on right and left halves",
