        "rationale": "<strong>ZMC Fractures:</strong> In a Zygomaticomaxillary Complex fracture, the zygomaticomaxillary buttress (the key pillar above the maxillary molars) is the most critical checkpoint. Re-establishing this buttress perfectly ensures proper anterior-posterior facial projection and vertical height.",
        "type": "dental-deck"
