        "front": "54. Which is true about mucogingival flap designs?<br><br><div class=\"deck-options\">a. Flaps should be wider at the base<br>b. Flaps should be narrower at the base<br>c. Flap margins should not rest on bone<br>d. Mucogingival flaps should be avoided</div>",
