        "deckName": "Oral Surgery & Anesthesia",
        "category": "Oral Surgery",
        "front": "57. When performing soft tissue biopsy, anesthetic solution should not be deposited within suspected lesion because:<br><br><div class=\"deck-options\">a. It can cause severe pain<br>b. It will delay would healing<br>c. It will cause further distortion of the specimen<br>d. Danger of spread of tumor cells</div>",
