        "front": "60. Incisional biopsy is indicated for which of the following lesions?<br><br><div class=\"deck-options\">a. 0.5cm papillary fibroma of the gingiva<br>b. 2cm exostosis of the hard palate<br>c. 3 cm hemangioma of the tongue<br>d. 3 cm area of leukoplakia of the soft palate</div>",
        "rawOptions": "a. 0.5cm papillary fibroma of the gingiva<br>b. 2cm exostosis of the hard palate<br>c. 3 cm hemangioma of the tongue<br>d. 3 cm area of leukoplakia of the soft palate",
