        "rationale": "<strong>Biopsy Indications:</strong> An incisional biopsy (taking only a piece of the lesion) is indicated for large, potentially malignant lesions (>1cm) like severe leukoplakia. Hemangiomas should <em>never</em> be routinely biopsied due to the risk of catastrophic bleeding.",
        "type": "dental-deck"
