        "rawOptions": "a. On/off switch<br>b. Exposure time<br>c. Milliamperage (mA)<br>d. Kilovolt peak (kVp)",
        "answer": "c. Milliamperage (mA)",
        "rationale": "<strong>Thermionic Emission:</strong> The mA dial controls the low-voltage circuit, directly regulating how hot the tungsten filament gets. The hotter the filament, the more electrons boil off the wire, increasing the <em>quantity</em> of x-rays.",
