        "rationale": "<strong>Voltage Regulation:</strong> The kVp setting controls the step-up transformer, taking the 110-220 volts from the wall outlet and converting it into the 65,000 to 100,000 volts needed to blast the electrons across the tube with highly penetrating force.",
