        "front": "29. During amelogenesis (enamel formation), ameloblasts secrete enamel matrix proteins. Which protein makes up approximately 90% of the organic matrix of newly secreted, unmineralized enamel?<br><br><div style=\"background: rgba(0,0,0,0.25); padding: 0.75rem; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>A.</strong> Amelogenin</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>B.</strong> Enamelin</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>C.</strong> Tuftelin</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>D.</strong> Collagen Type I</div></div>",
