        "category": "Pathology & Microbiology",
        "front": "100. The entire process of tooth crown formation is dictated by a flawless, deeply choreographed cellular signaling cascade known as \"Reciprocal Induction.\" What is the absolute FIRST step that initiates the actual secretion of hard tissue matrix?<br><br><div style=\"background: rgba(0,0,0,0.25); padding: 0.75rem; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>A.</strong> Ameloblasts secrete enamel, which signals odontoblasts to form dentin.</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>B.</strong> Odontoblasts secrete a layer of mantle dentin, which signals the ameloblasts to begin secreting enamel.</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>C.</strong> Cementoblasts secrete cementum onto the enamel.</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>D.</strong> The stellate reticulum collapses, crushing the enamel organ.</div></div>",
