        "rationale": "Self-etch systems rely on acidic monomers like 10-MDP. These incredibly smart molecules are acidic enough to dissolve the smear layer, but they leave the collagen perfectly intact and chemically bond directly to the calcium in the tooth.",
        "type": "prc-block"
