        "answer": "Correct Answer: B. The relationship of the maxillary incisal edges to the wet-dry line of the lower lip.",
        "rationale": "F and V sounds (Labiodental fricatives) are created by blowing air between the top front teeth and the bottom lip. If the teeth are too long, the 'F' sounds like a 'V'. If they are too short, the 'V' sounds like an 'F'.",
        "type": "prc-block"
