        "category": "Prostho & Materials",
        "front": "49. When evaluating a diagnostic cast, the \"Height of Contour\" (Survey Line) is identified using a surveyor. The area on the tooth situated GINGIVAL to (below) this survey line is defined as the:<br><br><div style=\"background: rgba(0,0,0,0.25); padding: 0.75rem; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>A.</strong> Suprabulge area</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>B.</strong> Undercut area</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>C.</strong> Guiding plane</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>D.</strong> Rest seat</div></div>",
