        "category": "Prostho & Materials",
        "front": "74. The setting reaction of zinc oxide-eugenol (ZOE) is severely accelerated by the presence of which environmental factor?<br><br><div style=\"background: rgba(0,0,0,0.25); padding: 0.75rem; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>A.</strong> Cold air</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>B.</strong> Moisture (Water) and heat</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>C.</strong> Blue light</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>D.</strong> Alcohol</div></div>",
