        "rationale": "ZOE impression paste is a classic for edentulous arches. Because it requires a custom tray and is spread incredibly thin, it doesn't flow down the throat. Furthermore, the eugenol physically numbs and soothes the tissue, drastically reducing the gag reflex.",
