        "front": "1. In the production of dental x-rays, the vast majority of the kinetic energy from the electrons striking the tungsten target is lost. Approximately what percentage of this energy is actually converted into useful x-ray photons?<br><br><div style=\"background: rgba(0,0,0,0.25); padding: 0.75rem; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>A.</strong> 1%</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>B.</strong> 25%</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>C.</strong> 50%</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>D.</strong> 99%</div></div>",
