        "rationale": "If you slice your finger and superglue the edges perfectly back together, it heals by Primary Intention (minimal scarring). If you pull a tooth out, you cannot close the massive hole. It must heal by Secondary Intention (slowly filling with a blood clot and new tissue from the bottom up).",
