        "front": "19. The maximum daily dose of Acetaminophen for a healthy adult has recently been lowered by the FDA to prevent accidental, lethal damage to which specific organ?<br><br><div style=\"background: rgba(0,0,0,0.25); padding: 0.75rem; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>A.</strong> The Kidneys (Renal failure)</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>B.</strong> The Stomach (Gastric ulcers)</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>C.</strong> The Liver (Hepatic necrosis)</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>D.</strong> The Heart (Myocardial infarction)</div></div>",
