        "front": "53. What physical-chemical property of a local anesthetic molecule dictates its DURATION of clinical anesthesia?<br><br><div style=\"background: rgba(0,0,0,0.25); padding: 0.75rem; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>A.</strong> Lipid solubility</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>B.</strong> Dissociation constant (pKa)</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>C.</strong> Protein binding capacity</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>D.</strong> pH of the solution</div></div>",
