        "front": "3. The 'Ugly Duckling' stage is a normal physiological stage of development characterized by a midline diastema and flared maxillary incisors. This stage occurs during the mixed dentition and spontaneously corrects itself upon the eruption of the:<br><br><div style=\"background: rgba(0,0,0,0.25); padding: 0.75rem; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>A.</strong> Maxillary central incisors</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>B.</strong> Maxillary lateral incisors</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>C.</strong> Maxillary permanent canines</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>D.</strong> Maxillary first premolars</div></div>",
