        "front": "21. To maintain an active license, professionals must comply with the Continuing Professional Development (CPD) Act of 2016 (R.A. 10912). What is the primary purpose of requiring CPD units for license renewal?<br><br><div style=\"background: rgba(0,0,0,0.25); padding: 0.75rem; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>A.</strong> To generate revenue for the PRC.</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>B.</strong> To ensure that professionals constantly update their knowledge, skills, and ethical values to maintain global competitiveness and high standards of service.</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>C.</strong> To force older dentists to retire early.</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>D.</strong> To fund the Philippine Dental Association.</div></div>",
