        "front": "22. In legal terms, the relationship between a dentist and a patient is fundamentally considered a:<br><br><div style=\"background: rgba(0,0,0,0.25); padding: 0.75rem; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>A.</strong> Fiduciary and contractual relationship</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>B.</strong> Master-servant relationship</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>C.</strong> Bilateral dictatorship</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>D.</strong> Guarantor relationship</div></div>",
