        "front": "25. Which of the following is considered completely UNETHICAL and illegal regarding professional fees in dentistry?<br><br><div style=\"background: rgba(0,0,0,0.25); padding: 0.75rem; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>A.</strong> Offering a discount to a fellow dentist or medical professional.</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>B.</strong> Providing free dental treatment to an indigent patient.</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>C.</strong> Fee splitting (giving a commission or kickback to someone solely for referring a patient to your clinic).</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>D.</strong> Charging a higher fee for a highly complex, time-consuming surgery.</div></div>",
