        "front": "29. In legal proceedings, a dentist called to testify in court strictly to interpret x-rays, explain complex surgical procedures, and give an opinion on the standard of care based on their specialized knowledge is acting as an:<br><br><div style=\"background: rgba(0,0,0,0.25); padding: 0.75rem; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>A.</strong> Ordinary witness</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>B.</strong> Expert witness</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>C.</strong> Hostile witness</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>D.</strong> Defendant</div></div>",
