        "category": "Jurisprudence & Ethics",
        "front": "31. A dental hygienist in the Philippines is licensed under RA 9484. What is the legal scope of practice for a registered dental hygienist?<br><br><div style=\"background: rgba(0,0,0,0.25); padding: 0.75rem; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>A.</strong> They can perform simple extractions.</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>B.</strong> They can diagnose cavities and prepare treatment plans.</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>C.</strong> They can perform oral prophylaxis, place sealants, and take radiographs strictly under the supervision of a licensed dentist.</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>D.</strong> They can practice completely independently and open their own clinic.</div></div>",
