        "rationale": "NUG is an acute, agonizing infection caused by stress, smoking, and spirochetes. The tips of the papillae literally die and rot away ('punched-out'), leaving a stinking, gray, necrotic slough. Treatment involves debridement, chlorhexidine, and often Metronidazole.",
