        "answer": "Correct Answer: B. EDTA",
        "rationale": "RC-Prep and similar lubricants are gels packed with EDTA. The EDTA chemically softens and dissolves the calcified dentin in the tight canal, while the gel base physically lubricates the tiny file so it doesn't snap.",
