        "front": "74. A patient requires Endodontic Retreatment because an old root canal failed. You must remove the rock-hard gutta-percha from inside the root. Which specific chemical solvent is most effectively and classically used to dissolve gutta-percha?<br><br><div style=\"background: rgba(0,0,0,0.25); padding: 0.75rem; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>A.</strong> Sodium hypochlorite</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>B.</strong> EDTA</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>C.</strong> Chloroform</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 4px;\"><strong>D.</strong> Eugenol</div></div>",
